      "snippet": {
        "line": 287,
        "text": "pressureSource C phi omega n := constant (C ^ 2)⁻¹ * (∑ i ∈ range (n+1), phi i * phi (n-i)) - constant (1/2) * omega, where omega = Ω_{n-1}/X"
